1- Create dns entries for 
   - qa.liftcl.com

   
2- Create configuration directories
     mkdir -p /app/gateway/gateway/nginx/conf.d/
     mkdir -p /app/gateway/gateway/nginx/sites/new
     mkdir -p /app/gateway/gateway/var

3- Copy all first_time_conf files into conf.d. This will configure nginx to respond to the correct domain names in order to let cerbot create certificates
    

   cp ./gateway/nginx/sites/new/first_time_conf/*.conf /app/gateway/gateway/nginx/conf.d

2- Run gateway
   docker-compose up -d
3- Use certbot in order to create certificate for each domain
docker exec -it gateway-gateway-1 certbot certonly --webroot -w /var/www/certbot -d  qa.liftcl.com


For for each site it will create certificate files. Please read carefullly the logs and edit the conf files in conf.d so that they point correctly to the certificate files

4-Copy all final_conf files into conf.d. This will configure nginx to respond to the correct services
cp ./gateway/nginx/sites/new/final_conf/*.conf /app/gateway/gateway/nginx/conf.d

4- Make nginx inside gateway refresh the conf files
docker exec -it gateway-gateway-1 nginx -s reload


If you dont have ssh certificate run: 


5- in conf/aws-develop/gateway/local run   docker-compose -p gateway up -d